  "releaseNotes": "1.5.0 — first release of the analyzer package, versioned in lockstep with the PostQuantum.FileEncryption family. Rules PQFE101–PQFE104: hard-coded passphrases, raw private-key bytes written to disk, discarded encrypt/decrypt/sign/verify tasks, and silently swallowed fail-closed exceptions. See the package README and docs/ANTI-PATTERNS.md for the reasoning behind each rule.",
